[3.4,"o","  task: the test ./sandbox/sum.test.mjs is failing. run it with 'node sandbox/sum.test.mjs', fix the bug in ./sandbox/sum.mjs, and rerun until it passes. only touch files in ./sandbox.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.3,"o","Fixed. The bug was in `sandbox/sum.mjs` — `sum` subtracted (`a - b`) instead of adding. Changed it to `a + b` and the test now passes: `PASS: sum(2, 3) = 5`.\r\n"]
